288
00:15:58,990 --> 00:16:02,330
What?

289
00:15:58,990 --> 00:16:02,330
"Why don't you call him?"

290
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:04,830
Well, thank you very much. Now he's gonna prep her.

291
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:10,210
You know, prep her, as in what you do before you surgically remove the boyfriend.

292
00:16:10,380 --> 00:16:11,630
Are you crazy?

293
