Hey.

376
00:20:23,930 --> 00:20:24,970
Hi.

377
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:26,260
What are you doing here?

378
00:20:26,430 --> 00:20:29,180
You know, this building's on my paper route, so...

379
00:20:29,390 --> 00:20:31,020
Oh. Hi.

380
00:20:29,390 --> 00:20:31,020
Hi.

381
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:32,230
How did it go?

382
00:20:32,390 --> 00:20:35,060
Oh, well, the woman I interviewed with was pretty tough...

383
00:20:35,230 --> 00:20:37,230
