399
00:21:02,300 --> 00:21:03,670
Oh! I did?

400
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:04,920
Yes.

401
00:21:05,090 --> 00:21:06,300
Oh, my God!

402
00:21:06,470 --> 00:21:09,010
Congratulations...

403
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:15,520
So, Phoebe.

404
00:21:15,690 --> 00:21:16,810
How was your date?

405
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:19,020
Oh, well, you know. Ha, ha.

406
00:21:19,190 --> 00:21:21,650
Yeah, I do know.

407
00:21:21,820 --> 00:21:23,230
Ick. You were eavesdropping?

408
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:27,280
Eavesdropping? Pheebs, the ceiling tiles were falling down.

409
00:21:28,990 --> 00:21:30,490
Oh, I'm sorry.

